PewterCity_Gym_Text_CliffPre::
    .string "Ice to meet you! Careful where\n"
    .string "you step. Around here, one bad\l"
    .string "move can snowball fast!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_CliffDefeat::
    .string "Snow way! I got completely iced!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_CliffAfter::
    .string "Keep climbing! The summit is that\n"
    .string "way. Try not to flake out!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_MilesPre::
    .string "You made it this high? N-ice!\n"
    .string "But the higher you climb, the\l"
    .string "colder it gets. Time for peak\l"
    .string "performance!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_MilesDefeat::
    .string "What a meltdown! I guess it was\n"
    .string "all downhill from there!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_MilesAfter::
    .string "BOREAL is just ahead. Better keep\n"
    .string "your cool. He sure will.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealPre::
    .string "So, you made it through the cold.\n"
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "Most Trainers think strength is\n"
    .string "what you have when everything is\l"
    .string "going your way.\p"
    .string "I don't.\p"
    .string "Cold stiffens your hands.\n"
    .string "It breaks your focus.\l"
    .string "It makes every decision harder.\p"
    .string "I've trained in this Gym until\n"
    .string "none of that matters to me.\l"
    .string "You haven't.\p"
    .string "That's my advantage.\p"
    .string "A real Trainer doesn't get to\n"
    .string "choose perfect conditions. You\l"
    .string "learn to perform when you're\l"
    .string "tired, distracted, uncomfortable,\l"
    .string "and everything around you is\l"
    .string "working against you.\p"
    .string "If you want the Fortitude Badge,\n"
    .string "prove you can do that.\p"
    .string "Remember this:\n"
    .string "Comfort makes you soft.\p"
    .string "Now show me how tough you really\n"
    .string "are!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealDefeat::
    .string "Hah.\n"
    .string "So the cold didn't break you after\l"
    .string "all.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealBadge::
    .string "That's what I wanted to see.\p"
    .string "You were uncomfortable.\n"
    .string "You were under pressure.\l"
    .string "And you kept making good decisions\l"
    .string "anyway.\p"
    .string "That's endurance.\p"
    .string "Anyone can look strong when\n"
    .string "everything is easy.\p"
    .string "What matters is what you can still\n"
    .string "do when conditions turn against\l"
    .string "you.\p"
    .string "You earned this.\n"
    .string "The Fortitude Badge.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealBadgeFollowup::
    .string "The Fortitude Badge proves you can\n"
    .string "keep your head when the battle\l"
    .string "stops being comfortable.\p"
    .string "Don't mistake that for permission\n"
    .string "to get comfortable now.\p"
    .string "The next Gym won't test you the\n"
    .string "same way I did.\l"
    .string "Good.\l"
    .string "It shouldn't.\p"
    .string "If you only know how to win under\n"
    .string "one set of conditions, you're not\l"
    .string "strong yet.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM55::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM55\n"
    .string "from BOREAL.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealTM55::
    .string "TM55 contains Icy Wind.\p"
    .string "It doesn't just hurt. It slows the\n"
    .string "other side down.\p"
    .string "That's the lesson here. You can't\n"
    .string "control every condition.\p"
    .string "Control the pace.\n"
    .string "Make the battle happen on your\l"
    .string "terms.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealFinal::
    .string "Remember what you learned here.\p"
    .string "Comfort makes you soft.\n"
    .string "But discomfort?\l"
    .string "That's where you find out what\l"
    .string "you're made of.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealRepeat::
    .string "You've got the Fortitude Badge.\p"
    .string "Now live up to it.\n"
    .string "Comfort makes you soft.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_NoRoomForTM55::
    .string "You don't have room for TM55.\n"
    .string "Come back when you do.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealRematchPre::
    .string "You came back.\n"
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "Last time you stood here, I made\n"
    .string "the conditions work against you.\l"
    .string "You endured them.\p"
    .string "Since then, you've faced stronger\n"
    .string "Trainers, harsher battles, and\l"
    .string "pressure I couldn't give you back\l"
    .string "then.\p"
    .string "But don't think I've been standing\n"
    .string "still.\l"
    .string "I've trained too.\p"
    .string "The cold is the same.\n"
    .string "I'm not.\p"
    .string "Let's find out how much stronger\n"
    .string "you've really become.\p"
    .string "Comfort makes you soft.\n"
    .string "Show me you're still uncomfortable.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealRematchDefeat::
    .string "Hah!\n"
    .string "Now that's endurance.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BorealRematchAfter::
    .string "That's different.\p"
    .string "The first time you came through\n"
    .string "here, you fought through the\l"
    .string "conditions.\p"
    .string "This time?\n"
    .string "You controlled the battle anyway.\p"
    .string "That's the difference between\n"
    .string "surviving pressure and mastering\l"
    .string "it.\p"
    .string "Don't expect another Badge.\n"
    .string "You've already proved what the\l"
    .string "Fortitude Badge says about you.\p"
    .string "I just wanted to know whether you\n"
    .string "still deserved it.\l"
    .string "You do.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiFirst::
    .string "First Gym?\n"
    .string "I'm Satoshi.\p"
    .string "I handle the trainer tips here.\p"
    .string "Boreal trains ICE Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Every battle in this Gym\n"
    .string "starts in HAIL.\p"
    .string "Anything that isn't ICE\n"
    .string "gets worn down by the cold.\p"
    .string "The floor is part of the\n"
    .string "test, too.\p"
    .string "The first time you step on\n"
    .string "a tile, it cracks.\p"
    .string "Step on that same tile again,\n"
    .string "and you're going through it.\p"
    .string "If you fall, you'll end up\n"
    .string "back here and the whole\l"
    .string "floor resets.\p"
    .string "The straight path is the\n"
    .string "safest.\p"
    .string "It also takes you through\n"
    .string "both Hikers.\p"
    .string "If you really want to avoid\n"
    .string "them, there are longer ways\l"
    .string "around.\p"
    .string "Want a little practice before\n"
    .string "you go in?$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiYes::
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "My Seel isn't an Ice-type,\n"
    .string "so watch both of us closely.\p"
    .string "Let's go!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiWin::
    .string "That's the idea.\p"
    .string "The weather doesn't care\n"
    .string "which side you're on.\p"
    .string "My Seel isn't Ice-type,\n"
    .string "so the Hail hurt it too.\p"
    .string "Boreal's Pokémon really\n"
    .string "ARE Ice-types.\p"
    .string "FIRE, FIGHTING, ROCK,\n"
    .string "and STEEL attacks can\l"
    .string "hit Ice hard.\p"
    .string "Just remember:\n"
    .string "Look at the Pokémon's\l"
    .string "actual type.\p"
    .string "Not what you think\n"
    .string "it ought to be.\p"
    .string "Good luck.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiLose::
    .string "See how quickly the cold\n"
    .string "starts adding up?\p"
    .string "That's what Boreal wants.\p"
    .string "You can try me again\n"
    .string "whenever you're ready.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiDecline::
    .string "Fair enough.\p"
    .string "Then remember this:\n"
    .string "HAIL wears down anything\l"
    .string "that isn't Ice-type.\p"
    .string "And Ice is weak to\n"
    .string "FIRE, FIGHTING, ROCK,\l"
    .string "and STEEL.\p"
    .string "Boreal will expect you\n"
    .string "to endure the cold.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiBeforeBoreal::
    .string "I've shown you what I can.\p"
    .string "Remember: one step cracks\n"
    .string "a tile. The second breaks it.\p"
    .string "The straight path is safest,\n"
    .string "but it takes you through\l"
    .string "both Hikers.\p"
    .string "Now go see what Boreal\n"
    .string "does with the real thing.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiAfterComplete::
    .string "You did it!\p"
    .string "And more importantly, you\n"
    .string "didn't let the Gym beat you\l"
    .string "before Boreal could.\p"
    .string "The ice, the Hail, the long\n"
    .string "route... all of it was there\l"
    .string "to make you rush or lose\l"
    .string "focus.\p"
    .string "You didn't.\p"
    .string "That Fortitude Badge suits\n"
    .string "you.\p"
    .string "Keep it in mind when the\n"
    .string "next Gym throws something\l"
    .string "completely different at you.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiAfterSkipped::
    .string "You skipped my practice\n"
    .string "battle and still handled\l"
    .string "Boreal?\p"
    .string "All right.\n"
    .string "Maybe you didn't need the\l"
    .string "warm-up after all.\p"
    .string "Nice work.\p"
    .string "That Fortitude Badge suits\n"
    .string "you.\p"
    .string "Keep it in mind when the\n"
    .string "next Gym throws something\l"
    .string "completely different at you.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_MainSign::
    .string "PEWTER CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "THE ENDURANCE GYM\p"
    .string "LEADER: BOREAL\p"
    .string "COMFORT MAKES YOU SOFT.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_ThinIceSign::
    .string "THIN ICE.\p"
    .string "ONE STEP CRACKS IT.\n"
    .string "STEP TWICE AND YOU DROP.$"
